## Phase 4 — Replace LangSmith Stub with Real SDK Tracing

### Step 4.1 — Update `LangSmithTracingService.sendToLangSmith()`

**File:** `backend/src/modules/ai-gateway/langsmith-tracing.service.ts`

```typescript
private async sendToLangSmith(events: LangSmithEvent[]): Promise<void> {
  if (!this.config.enabled || !this.config.apiKey) return;
  try {
    const { Client } = await import('langsmith');
    const client = new Client({ apiUrl: this.config.endpoint, apiKey: this.config.apiKey });
    for (const event of events) {
      if (event.type === 'start') {
        await client.createRun({ name: event.name ?? 'unnamed', run_type: 'chain',
          inputs: event.data as Record<string, unknown>, project_name: this.config.project });
      }
    }
  } catch (error) {
    this.logger.warn(`LangSmith flush failed (non-fatal): ${error}`);
    // NEVER propagate — tracing failures must not block agent execution
  }
}
```

Dynamic import keeps startup cost zero when disabled.

### Step 4.2 — Wrap `AgentPlannerService.buildLlmPlan()` with tracing

Add `LangSmithTracingService` to constructor (available globally via `@Global() AIGatewayModule`). Wrap `chain.invoke()` with `startSpan`/`endSpan`. Catch any tracing error — never let it propagate.

### Step 4.3 — Same for `AgentEvaluatorService.llmEvaluate()`

Span name: `'agent.evaluate'`.

