## SOLID Adherence Summary

| Principle | Application                                                                                                                                         |
| --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **SRP**   | Graph orchestrates; planner plans; evaluator evaluates; factory selects providers; tracing service traces                                           |
| **OCP**   | `LLMFactory.createLangChainLLM()` and `StructuredToolRegistry.toLangChainTools()` are new methods — no existing methods modified                    |
| **LSP**   | All services still implement existing interfaces; `DynamicStructuredTool` wraps `IStructuredTool` without subclassing                               |
| **ISP**   | Callers use only the surface they need; all new parameters optional                                                                                 |
| **DIP**   | `AgentPlannerService` depends on `LLMFactory` abstraction, not `ChatOpenAI` concrete; graph depends on `IAgentPlanner`/`IAgentEvaluator` interfaces |

